  p1_desc: "An AI mentoring platform for traders, on sale since 28 September 2026 on the web, iPhone and Mac. The AI mentor Milo learns each trader's own written method and holds them to it. Agents prepare the session plan, watch the risk rules during the day, review the day after the close and build a long-term picture of the trader from evidence. I built it alone, from the process map and architecture to the code, quality, costs and sales. It is early stage, in production and on sale.",
