  skills_have: "<div class=\"skill\"><b>AI agents (LangGraph)</b><span>Graphs with a fixed shape and a human approval step, a ReAct agent with 10 tools and memory, tool loops, checkpointers. Code computes and the model interprets.</span><span class=\"ev\">Proof: Trader AI Assistant · Deep Mentor</span></div><div class=\"skill\"><b>LLM application development</b><span>Gemini in production, including Gemini Live for speech. A registry of 51 AI roles where I can switch a model without a deploy, models chosen on test cases, and a cost ledger that reserves budget before every call.</span><span class=\"ev\">Proof: Trader AI Assistant · Murmur</span></div><div class=\"skill\"><b>Retrieval and agent memory</b><span>A structured memory of the user and hybrid full-text and vector search (pgvector, RRF). Recall went from 23% to 85%. Search over short knowledge cards for a local model.</span><span class=\"ev\">Proof: Deep Mentor · I'm here</span></div><div class=\"skill\"><b>LLM evaluation and observability</b><span>Over 260 prompt test cases in promptfoo, an LLM as a judge, traces in Langfuse, regular audits with an error taxonomy and findings merged by cause, and an open-source library that follows a finding from discovery to closure.</span><span class=\"ev\">Proof: audit-mentor · finding-ledger</span></div><div class=\"skill\"><b>MCP (Model Context Protocol)</b><span>My own MCP servers (OAuth 2.1 and PKCE in the platform, 38 tools in the research agent) and a TradingView MCP client.</span><span class=\"ev\">Proof: Trader AI Assistant · Scout</span></div><div class=\"skill\"><b>On-device AI</b><span>Local models on MLX answering from retrieved knowledge cards, Whisper and Parakeet on Core ML, TranslateGemma through llama.cpp, a small speech detector tested on the phone in quiet and in noise, memory and heat limits on a phone, and an encrypted agent memory that stays on the devices.</span><span class=\"ev\">Proof: I'm here · Murmur · agent with memory</span></div><div class=\"skill\"><b>Swift and Apple platforms</b><span>Swift 6, SwiftUI, AppKit, Core Audio, Live Activities, push notifications, Keychain, Sign in with Apple, TestFlight and App Store preparation, notarization. Apps for iPhone and Mac that I use every day.</span><span class=\"ev\">Proof: Trader AI Assistant apps · I'm here · Murmur</span></div><div class=\"skill\"><b>Realtime voice AI</b><span>Live transcription of both sides, interpretation in both directions at once, speech detection tested on the same recordings and with a real microphone, latency limits across parallel model sessions, speech synthesis and voice cloning run locally.</span><span class=\"ev\">Proof: I'm here · Murmur</span></div><div class=\"skill\"><b>Production Python</b><span>Async FastAPI services, websockets, layered architecture, risk logic covered by unit tests.</span><span class=\"ev\">Proof: Scout · trading system</span></div><div class=\"skill\"><b>Product and infrastructure</b><span>PostgreSQL with row-level isolation on my own server, Docker, CI/CD gates, Stripe subscriptions, OIDC sign-in, GDPR export. Earlier Cloud Run, Firebase and Supabase. Now testing Microsoft Foundry and Azure AI Search.</span><span class=\"ev\">Proof: Trader AI Assistant</span></div><div class=\"skill\"><b>Process analysis</b><span>Interviews, data from the systems, a process map with exceptions and owners, and each step assigned to delete, code, agent or person, with a baseline before building and a measurement after.</span><span class=\"ev\">Proof: mentoring process · accounting close</span></div><div class=\"skill\"><b>Human-in-the-loop design</b><span>Approval points where a mistake is costly, review loops, limits on what an agent may do alone, and helping people adopt a new tool. My background in psychology and five years of lecturing help here.</span><span class=\"ev\">Proof: every project above</span></div>",
